{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 82527, "game_id": 1164, "entry_id": 57579, "uid": 94239, "type": 4, "title": "无氪乱斗个人心得", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1625808822, "updated_at": 1628237164, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1628237164, "last_at": 1685999268, "comment_count": 0, "status": 1, "summary": "3、4星的乱斗很容易两极分化，点火较为容易，舍得点火的能全红，很容易往前冲。但本人是无氪玩家，石头大多留给PVE，此攻略适用于追求性价比的玩家。先看乱斗奖励从5%到200奖励提升明显，再往后投入，奖励", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dcj/1627690392379_59190063.jpg,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dcj/1627690376745_30725492.jpg", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 11, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 7795, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 6, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 82527, "content": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"\">3</span><span style=\"\">、</span><span style=\"\">4</span><span style=\"\">星的乱斗很容易两极分化，点火较为容易，舍得点火的能全红，很容易往前冲。但本人是无氪玩家，石头大多留给</span><span style=\"\">PVE</span><span style=\"\">，此攻略适用于追求性价比的玩家。</span><span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"\"><o:p style=\"\">&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">先看乱斗奖励</span></span></span></font></span></p><br><p></p><div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625810841216_31095843.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625810841216_31095843.png\" style=\"height: 385px;\" alt=\"无氪乱斗个人心得\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">从</font>5%<font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">到</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">200</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">奖励提升明显，再往后投入，奖励提升不大。而且在日服，</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">4%</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">（有时），</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">3%</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">（必定）也算在</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">101~200</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">之内（</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">3200</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">分以上）。所以我们的目标是</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">101~200</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">之内。</font></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\">&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">乱斗规则：</font>15<font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">个天子分为</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">3</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">行</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">5</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">列，一位天子阵亡后，下一列的天子补上，且会释放</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">SS</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">。如果超时，天子多的一方胜；如果天子数量一样，血多的一方胜利</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">(</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">存疑</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">)</font></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\">&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">3<font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">、</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">4</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">星天子（点火）推荐</font></span><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">：</font></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\">1<font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">、<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">前言</span>：与</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">5</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">星天子不同，</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">3</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">、</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">4</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">星天子点火很少有质变的效果，点火很多时候只是略微提升了技能的数值和点火石头本身的属性，所以经常会出现</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">30W</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">战力吊打了</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">60W</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">战力的满火队，这在</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">5</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">星乱斗都是很魔幻的存在。</font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\"></font></span></p><div class=\"div-img\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625810914142_79553016.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625810914142_79553016.png\" style=\"height: 163px;\" alt=\"无氪乱斗个人心得\"></font></div><div class=\"div-img\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\"><br></font></div><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\"><br></font><p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\">2<font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">、<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">点火刀推荐</span></span>：不点火的刀上场就是刮痧（毒刀例外）</font></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></p><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625810940893_76440795.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625810940893_76440795.png\" style=\"height: 137px;\" alt=\"无氪乱斗个人心得\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">火达比：非常推荐，</font>SS<font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">和大招是全体攻击，点火性价比非常高，装备建议带个吸血，能苟能打。点火石注意选个攻防兼备的石头。</font></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\">&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">木机器人：主要是</font>PVE<font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">好用，顺带着</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">PVP</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">带着</font></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\"><br></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\"></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">毒刀：</font>3<font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">、</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">4</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">星乱斗最好用的</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">Debuff</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">就是中毒，</font></span></font></p><div class=\"div-img\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625810973479_23943969.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625810973479_23943969.png\" alt=\"无氪乱斗个人心得\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">想省点火石也可以不点，差别不是太大。</font></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">毒刀点火石主要苟一点，撑的时间长一点给对面上中毒</font></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\">&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">其他刀：都差不多一个水平，有余力的可以点光刀，可以减疗。</font></span></p><div class=\"div-img\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625811000235_94970255.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625811000235_94970255.png\" alt=\"无氪乱斗个人心得\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">←还不会没人没点吧</span></font></div><div class=\"div-img\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><br></span></font></div><div class=\"div-img\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"\">3、</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">点火盾推荐</span></span>：其实单从功能上来说，嘲讽</font>+<font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">反射盾爆了莫娜十条街，但是</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">3</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">星盾一个个长的都歪瓜裂枣的，看着真没欲望点。</font></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">总之就看个人喜好吧，点一两个盾就够，因为你盾都开始死了，说明你其他的都死的差不多了。</font></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></p><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625811045645_67361844.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625811045645_67361844.png\" style=\"height: 154px;\" alt=\"无氪乱斗个人心得\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" id=\"true\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"\">4、</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">（点火）辅助推荐</span></font></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">优先练拉条角色，因为先出手</font>DS<font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">会占据很大优势。点火没有太推荐的，因为性价比一般。</font></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\">&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">关于加攻击类天子，比如丽莎，我个人觉的如果你装备和点火石不是太好，刀搭配丽莎是打不穿对面嘲讽盾的。当然如果你达比练度特别高，能隔山打牛干穿对面，那也能上场。</font></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\">&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"\">5、</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">（点火）妨害推荐</span></font></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">单独推荐一下稻草人，虽然沉默概率不高。沉默到就是赚到。</font></span></p><div class=\"div-img\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625811086005_16875027.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625811086005_16875027.png\" style=\"height: 192px;\" alt=\"无氪乱斗个人心得\"></font></div><div class=\"div-img\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">其他妨害型，优先练减条和眩晕天子，如</font></span></font></p><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\"><br></font></div><div class=\"div-img\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625811138761_14786760.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625811138761_14786760.png\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\" alt=\"无氪乱斗个人心得\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625811164491_23349791.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625811164491_23349791.png\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; height: 102px;\" alt=\"无氪乱斗个人心得\"><br></font></div><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><span style=\"\">6、</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">（点火）回复推荐</span></font></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">优先练可以解</font>Debuff<font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">的天子，如</font></span></p><div class=\"div-img\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625811203035_33705747.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625811203035_33705747.jpg\" alt=\"无氪乱斗个人心得\"></font></div><div class=\"div-img\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">或者奶量特别大的天子，如</font></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></font></p><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\"><br><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625811213691_23577113.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625811213691_23577113.png\" alt=\"无氪乱斗个人心得\"></div></font></div><p></p><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">阵型</span></span>：</font></span></p><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625811223240_88810338.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1625811223240_88810338.png\" alt=\"无氪乱斗个人心得\"></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div></font></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div></font></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span><p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\">&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">第一行一般是一个嘲讽盾，一把刀，一个回复（可有可无），妨害型（减条），辅助型（拉条），</font>34<font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">乱斗之中刀很少能通过</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">SS,NS</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">输出（除非石头和装备很好），都是通过抢第一个</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">DS</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">，谁先进入</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">FT</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">，谁就会取得优势。第二行一般是上一行的同类型天子，第三行可以补一个嘲讽</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">+</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">反射盾。</font></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">一般</font>3~4<font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">把点火刀</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">+</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">毒刀就够用。如果没图中那么多石头，可以把图中点火刀换成辅助和妨害。</font></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\">&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">关于队长的选择：</font>3<font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">星乱斗丽莎，莫娜。 &nbsp;</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">4</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">星可以选减攻天子</font></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\">&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\">&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\">4<font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">星乱斗可以用三星天子，但由于基础属性有差距，</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">4</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">星乱斗中</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">4</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">星很少能被</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">3</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">星放</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">DS</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">打死。</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">4</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">星刀点火太贵了，所以只更换上位的辅助妨害回复天子，刀不变。</font></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\">&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\">&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">总结</span>：</font>3<font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">、</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">4</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">星乱斗环境基本不会随着版本变化，所以今天点火，基本能玩到关服。所以有多余石头的时候，投资给</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">3</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">、</font><font face=\"Calibri\" style=\"\">4</font><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\">星乱斗是不错的选择。</font></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\"></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\"><br></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\" id=\"true\">--------------------------------------------</font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt;\"><o:p style=\"\">&nbsp;最后贴一下本人的阵容，有待改进。混个前200够了</o:p></span></p><br><section class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dcj/1627690376745_30725492.jpg\" alt=\"无氪乱斗个人心得\" data-upload=\"true\"></section></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><br></span></font></div></font><p></p></font></div><p></p><br><p></p><section class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dcj/1627690392379_59190063.jpg\" alt=\"无氪乱斗个人心得\" data-upload=\"true\"></section></div><br></div><br></div><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\"><!--[if gte vml 1]><v:shapetype id=\"_x0000_t75\"\n coordsize=\"21600,21600\" o:spt=\"75\" o:preferrelative=\"t\" path=\"m@4@5l@4@11@9@11@9@5xe\"\n filled=\"f\" stroked=\"f\">\n <v:stroke joinstyle=\"miter\"></v:stroke>\n <v:formulas>\n  <v:f eqn=\"if lineDrawn pixelLineWidth 0\"></v:f>\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum @0 1 0\"></v:f>\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum 0 0 @1\"></v:f>\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @2 1 2\"></v:f>\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelWidth\"></v:f>\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @3 21600 pixelHeight\"></v:f>\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum @0 0 1\"></v:f>\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @6 1 2\"></v:f>\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelWidth\"></v:f>\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum @8 21600 0\"></v:f>\n  <v:f eqn=\"prod @7 21600 pixelHeight\"></v:f>\n  <v:f eqn=\"sum @10 21600 0\"></v:f>\n </v:formulas>\n <v:path o:extrusionok=\"f\" gradientshapeok=\"t\" o:connecttype=\"rect\"></v:path>\n <o:lock v:ext=\"edit\" aspectratio=\"t\"></o:lock>\n</v:shapetype><v:shape id=\"图片_x0020_1\" o:spid=\"_x0000_i1025\" type=\"#_x0000_t75\"\n alt=\"IMG_256\" style='width:309pt;height:281.4pt'>\n <v:fill o:detectmouseclick=\"t\"></v:fill>\n <v:imagedata src=\"file:///C:/Users/封尘魔~1/AppData/Local/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image001.png\"\n  o:title=\"IMG_256\"></v:imagedata>\n</v:shape><![if !vml]><img width=412 height=375\nsrc=\"file:///C:/Users/封尘魔~1/AppData/Local/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image002.jpg\"\nalt=\"IMG_256\" v:shapes=\"图片_x0020_1\"><!></span>\n</body>\n\n--></span><span style=\"fon